  "name": "transcript: recapture at done resets a review-captured transcript_ref to null",
  "slug": "transcript-recapture-at-done-resets-a-review-captured-transc",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "review and done each independently re-run captureTranscript, so a transcript captured at review is silently reset to null at done when the harness is not auto-detected (e.g. other) and --transcript is not re-passed — losing the audit trail.",
    "details_md": "Surfaced by the web-real-repo test: for harness `other`, `--transcript <path>` must be passed at BOTH review and done or the review-time transcript_ref is overwritten with null at done. A recapture that finds nothing should preserve an existing transcript_ref, not clear it. Fold into the transcript-capture hardening.",
    "acceptance": [
      "when a session already has a non-null transcript_ref and a later stop/review/done recapture finds no new transcript, transcript_ref is preserved (not reset to null)",
      "a test covers review-then-done for harness other without re-passing --transcript keeping the captured transcript"
    ],
    "context": [
      "src/sessions/transcript.ts captureTranscript",
      "src/cli/commands/{review,done,stop,drop}.ts",
      "found via tests/acceptance/web-real-repo.test.ts"
    ],
